    <!-- Section 4: Accessibility & Environmental Responsibility -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xxl); padding-top: var(--space-xl); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);">
      <div class="c-colophon-section-header">
        <div>
          <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">Standards &amp; Integrity</p>
          <h2 id="accessibility-respect" class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--color-primary);">
            Accessibility &amp; Respect
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <ul style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); padding-left: 1.25rem;">
            <li><strong>WCAG 2.1 AA/AAA Compliant:</strong> Every color pair, interactive element, and typography scale is mathematically checked against contrast ratios up to 18:1.</li>
            <li><strong>Zero Tracking &amp; Cookies:</strong> No behavioral trackers, advertising pixels, or telemetry beacons. Your reading experience is completely private.</li>
            <li><strong>Minimal Data Conduits:</strong> We run zero analytics, tracking beacons, or marketing scripts. When you submit a project dispatch via <em>The Next Thing</em>, messages route cleanly through a single external form relay (Formspree) without databases or tracking cookies—detailed fully in our <a href="/privacy/#formspree" class="u-text-clay-accessible">Privacy Policy&nbsp;&rarr;</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Syndication Freedom:</strong> Full Atom/RSS syndication available at <a href="/feed.xml" class="u-text-clay-accessible">/feed.xml</a> for open web subscribers.</li>
            <li><strong>Discoverability &amp; Sitemaps:</strong> Human-readable navigation directory at <a href="/sitemap/" class="u-text-clay-accessible">/sitemap/</a> and crawler index at <a href="/sitemap.xml" class="u-text-clay-accessible">/sitemap.xml</a>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

